   "type": "hero_update",
   "title": "INTRODUCING HAZARD",
   "role": null,
   "description": "Step into the fray with Hazard, a Tank hero unlike any other. This brawl dive disruptor is here to fight against injustice with high mobility and a wall-placing ability that brings new layers of strategy to the game. Inspired by his Scottish roots and the punk ethos of his faction, the Phreaks, Hazard is all about rebellion, resilience, and radical justice for the greater good. Embrace anarchy and reshape the battlefield! Try out Hazard in your unranked games during a limited-time trial now through November 25.",
